# Names

This example takes a very simple dataset (a table with 5 columns) and shows how you can do various kinds of analysis.

* [Basic Analysis](names1.malloy) - Build a very simple semantic model with only dimensions and measures and write some queries.
* [Views as unit of Reusibility](names2.malloy) - Using views built into a source, explore data.
